d amazing trails while hiking and took a photo that Nate admired for its dark sky and green scenery.\n  - keepsakes: Joanna shared a picture of her cork board, which contains quotes, photos, and little keepsakes.\n  - photos: Joanna shared a picture of her cork board, which contains quotes, photos, and little keepsakes. Nate previously encouraged Joanna to take photos of her hike to a waterfall.\n  - pic: Joanna mentioned she has a pic she got a while back.\n  - dark sky: The 'dark sky' was present in a picture taken by Joanna while hiking, which Nate commented on as having green scenery.\n  - quotes: Joanna shared a picture of her cork board, which contains quotes, photos, and keepsakes.\n  - picture: Nate complimented Joanna's drawings, asking what inspired them. Joanna previously mentioned seeing her writing acted out and Nate complimented a hiking picture.\n  - cute pic: Nate shared a cute picture of his family with Joanna, asking why he hung it on his cork board. Joanna previously found the picture adorable and asked Nate why he chose them as pets.\n  - town: Joanna went hiking and found amazing trails in her town, leading her to believe she is now an expert hiker.\n  - town: Joanna discovered more amazing hiking trails in her town recently, finding the experience awesome.\n  - cork board: Joanna has a picture on her cork board; Nate previously asked why she hung a great family picture there. Nate mentioned starting his own cork board as it seems valuable.\n  - the trail: Joanna found an awesome, gorgeous hiking trail in her hometown. Nate is curious to see what the trail looks like and heard there is a nice trail just north of where he lives.\n  - Joanna: Joanna is filming her own movie based on her road-trip script. She finds every day on set awesome and is excited to show her vision.\n  - ideas: Joanna mentioned getting ideas from people she knows, things she saw, and her imagination, which take shape into characters.\n  - the last one: Joanna is inspired to